# pop'n music 9, after popn9-card-new.his (same --nvram): the registered card again. The server
# returns the player data (userdata.read), the game skips the name and asks the PIN; 1234 shows
# the player's name, character and options, then p_friend.get and userid.ctou.
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-card-again.his
game popn9
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5400 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 5430 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 5460 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 5490 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 5520 press "Keypad Enter" 8
at 5570 snap
at 5700 snap
at 5850 snap
at 6050 snap
at 6350 snap
at 6750 snap
at 7250 snap
at 7260 quit
